  "stage": "Public repository, folder gate/: live code generation po-v4; our 25 and the held-out 13 attack invoices; the recorded Run 1, Run 2, Run 3, Run 4 and Run 5 receipts; the Run 5 suite, runner, test file and summary; the 5-invoice recorded receipt; the archived po-v4, hold-v3 and patched-v2 code manifests; the Run 4 known-38 wrapper and second-blind set; verify.html, the AP desk (desk.html, desk.mjs, desk-data.mjs, desk-data-run5.mjs and the script that builds the data), a page that forwards the old playground address to the desk, and the three recount scripts. README.md, LICENSE and media/ sit one level up and are not listed here. Round B.12 adds the local desk server (desk-server.mjs, desk-live.mjs), the field reader used by the hosted Try tab (invoice-reader.mjs), their tests, and one scripted live desk session: its signed receipt, the signed ledger of its pasted invoice, and a summary. It also holds the receipts and pasted-invoice ledgers of two further scripted sessions recorded for the demo video.",
